     <P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415344915.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415344907.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415344984.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415344924.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415344906.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415344969.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415351628.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415351619.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415351697.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415351637.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415351618.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415351681.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415351608.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415355613.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415355604.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415355682.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415355628.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415355609.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415355691.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415355618.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090415361344.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt" lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>“大梦想、新征程、亮青春”绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>年第一学期开学典礼在校锡麟体育馆隆重举行。绍兴一中校长、党委副书记朱雯，绍兴一中党委书记、副校长陈银伟，绍兴一中副校长、党委副书记陈柏良，绍兴一中副校长、党委纪委书记俞建种，绍兴一中副校长蒋明出席大会。本次典礼特别邀请了<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>届毕业生秦川学长与绍兴一中全体教师、学生一起聆听这“开学第一课”。典礼由陈银伟书记主持。<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">首先，校长朱雯发表《坚定脚下的步伐，这是你的荣光之路》的主题讲话。朱雯校长回顾了<SPAN lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN>届高三学子的辉煌成绩、学校社团的优异成绩和部分学生的实践活动。希望在新学期，每位一中学子可以做到求真求实，创新创造，做一个“抱定宗旨、砥砺德行、博雅通达”的未来世界精英，做一个求真、创新、有担当、有情怀、有爱与被爱的一中人，在仰望星空的同时，脚踏实地，铸就自己一生的荣光之路。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">高三（<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>）班陈齐治作为学科竞赛杰出代表发言。陈齐治在第<SPAN lang=EN-US>35</SPAN>届全国青少年信息学奥林匹克竞赛中取得了金牌并被北京大学预录取。会上他与在座的同学们分享了这三年学习信息学竞赛的经历。这三年并不是一帆风顺的，有过失望、打击和挫折，但因心中永不忘却的目标，如今才能重拾信心，圆梦赛场。正是心中有梦，砥砺前行，才散发出别人眼中所谓的幸运之光。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">高三（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）班江子焕作为社团代表分享了自己作为一中模联人的“博雅梦”。第一届博雅模联大会的顺利召开在模联圈里成功树立起了“绍兴一中博雅模联”的这块招牌。绍兴一中模联经过几代人的积淀，始终坚持“学术至上”的原则，终于迎来黄金时代。他希望大家都能心怀“博雅梦”，用理想信念浇灌中华民族的复兴梦。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">高一（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）班的张明珠代表高一新生发表发言。<SPAN lang=EN-US>700</SPAN>多位怀揣梦想的优秀学子怀着对绍兴一中的憧憬，对自身未来的执着期盼踏入一中校园，开启了多姿多彩的高中生活。高中三年的生活会是辛苦的，但是她相信历经沧桑后，在蓦然为首之时，韶华定不负。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">新生家长代表也上台对一中老师的付出表达了谢意。他说，非常放心孩子在绍兴一中度过三年的学习生活。他鼓励同学们，高一、高二和高三学生各有各的责任和担当，立足脚下，明确有所为而有所不为，相信一中学子最终都能够在绚烂的人生舞台上大放光彩。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">受邀嘉宾<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>届毕业生秦川学长为学弟学妹们分享他的一中故事和求学经历。他说，一中的学习经历赋予了他如今坚守使命的底气。两年前，他创作了《真味一中》美食宣传片，轰动一时。一中特有的文化基因串成了一条纽带，又聚合成牢不可破的基因序列，让一中的教师学生，一草一木都带有了一中独有的风味。一中的辉煌，有你，有我，有他的共同见证和坚守。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">典礼上，陈银伟书记宣读了市属级以上先进和校级先进教师的名单、<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>年教龄老师及一中工作满<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>年老师名单。俞建种副校长、陈柏良副校长和蒋明副校长分别宣读了上学期在各方面获奖的优秀学生名单。校级领导为荣誉教师与优秀学生颁奖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt">绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>年新学期开学典礼在掌声中圆满结束。新学期，一中学子定会把握机会，完善自我，书写属于自己的精彩人生，铸就自己一生的荣光之路。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P align=center> </P>
    
